{"id":1401,"date":"2026-08-22T22:03:55","date_gmt":"2026-08-22T22:03:55","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=1401"},"modified":"2026-08-22T22:28:27","modified_gmt":"2026-08-22T22:28:27","slug":"the-selection-pane","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/layout-tools\/the-selection-pane\/","title":{"rendered":"The Selection Pane"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">The Selection Pane<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1413\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheSelectionPane.webp\" alt=\"The Selection Pane\" width=\"98\" height=\"101\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheSelectionPane.webp 932w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheSelectionPane-289x300.webp 289w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/TheSelectionPane-768x796.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 98px) 100vw, 98px\" \/><\/span><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">The Selection Pane gives you full visibility and control over every element on the canvas, making it easy to select, hide, or rename even deeply buried, stacked, or obscured objects.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Opening the Selection Pane<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1411\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectionPaneOpening.webp\" alt=\"Opening the Selection Pane\" width=\"98\" height=\"89\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectionPaneOpening.webp 489w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectionPaneOpening-300x272.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 98px) 100vw, 98px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">Go to <strong>Home &gt; Select &gt; Selection Pane<\/strong>. The pane slides out on the right side of the workspace and displays a scrollable list of every object on the canvas, sorted top-to-bottom to match their true visual Z-index &#8211; the topmost element in the list is the one in front on the canvas.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">What You Can Do<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-1409\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatCanYouDo.webp\" alt=\"What You Can Do\" width=\"146\" height=\"116\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatCanYouDo.webp 416w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/WhatCanYouDo-300x239.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 146px) 100vw, 146px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Select an element &#8211;<\/strong> Click its entry in the pane and it is immediately highlighted on the canvas.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Show \/ Hide &#8211;<\/strong> Click the eye icon on any entry to toggle its visibility. Hidden elements are invisible on screen and excluded from PDF exports.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Show All \/ Hide All &#8211;<\/strong> Use the bulk buttons at the top of the pane to toggle all elements at once.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Rename an element &#8211;<\/strong> Click the element&#8217;s name in the pane to activate an inline edit field. Type a descriptive name (for example: \u201cBackground Logo\u201d or \u201cFooter Bar\u201d) and press <strong>Enter<\/strong> to save it.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Real-Time Updates<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The Selection Pane updates in real time via a native MutationObserver &#8211; no manual refresh is needed. Add an element, delete one, or move something on the canvas and the pane reflects it instantly.<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-1404 size-full\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258.jpeg\" alt=\"Real-Time Updates\" width=\"1376\" height=\"833\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258.jpeg 1376w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258-300x182.jpeg 300w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258-1024x620.jpeg 1024w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258-768x465.jpeg 768w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/Editing_images_with_teal_table_202608222258-240x145.jpeg 240w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1376px) 100vw, 1376px\" \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Selection Pane The Selection Pane gives you full visibility and control over every element on the canvas, making it easy to select, hide, or rename even deeply buried, stacked, or obscured objects. Opening the Selection Pane Go to Home &gt; Select &gt; Selection Pane. The pane slides out on the right side of the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1413,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[20],"class_list":["post-1401","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-layout-tools"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1401","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=1401"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1401\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":1418,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/1401\/revisions\/1418"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1413"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1401"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=1401"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}